<title>UK: BOE allots 688 mln stg in bills, repo s.</title>
<headline>BOE allots 688 mln stg in bills, repo s.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of England said that it allotted 688 million stg in repos and outright bills in the early round of operations after forecasting a liquidity shortage of 900 million. </p>
<p>It allotted 500 million stg in bills maturing on or before April 1 and 188 million in 6.0 percent fixed rate repos to April 1.</p>
